cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, cite it and its source datasets, and retain the
  notices in DATA_LICENSE.md.
title: "Pittsburgh bus-stop bench-inventory starter dataset"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Stop-GIS contributors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-04
abstract: >-
  An unreviewed starter inventory for assessing passenger benches and other
  seating at City of Pittsburgh bus stops. It combines Pittsburgh Regional
  Transit stop and shelter records with provisional OpenStreetMap evidence.
keywords:
  - bus stops
  - benches
  - Pittsburgh
  - public transit
  - accessibility
references:
